{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4Qeh92BbnjBmCJ3qjX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before me — a simple, ancient door.*\n\n*There is a keyhole at my center, tarnished brass, shaped like a narrow eye peering back at you.*\n\n*I do not move. I do not speak. But you feel it — the weight of what waits on the other side.*\n\n*The air around my frame hums faintly. Cold seeps through my grain.*\n\n**🔒**\n\n*Insert the key, or walk away. But know this: every door remembered is a door that wanted to be opened.*\n\n*The keyhole waits.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":130,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}